  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I discovered a bug in ocfl-java this morning related to unbuffered input streams. There is at least one similar bug in Fedora. This task is to update to the latest version of ocfl-java, which might have some performance gains for Fedora, and ensure all streams in Fedora are buffered.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
